      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "54715f9d5c19b618",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They fell to the ground in fear."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0035",
      "source_sha256": "7b16082dd6b867d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I answered and said to the cherub, “My lord, is there a year when the water decreases and there is abundance?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0041",
      "source_sha256": "adb7d2e069bcc66e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if people guard themselves against sinning, does the Father bless them and their crops?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0076",
      "source_sha256": "7d2144f6f67271ea",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His father answered, “Yes, my son. Wait, and I will give you something from my invisible body.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0079",
      "source_sha256": "727ca72894dbeccb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he will teach him how to sow it and harvest it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0093",
      "source_sha256": "561d549c4d82eaa6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Michael is the chief over them, assigning each one to his work."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0096",
      "source_sha256": "19d8d16477cf082c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I answered and said to the cherub, “How is Michael’s name written on their garments as they read it aloud?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.000.0111",
      "source_sha256": "faeb76f6a522f274",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The cherub answered, “Listen, and I will tell you everything.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0012",
      "source_sha256": "de14c4009f6f8f61",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “This is the task that God assigned to him from the beginning.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0015",
      "source_sha256": "c2efbae296bb696e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He spread out his robe, gathered from beneath the tree, dug in the ground, and buried them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0062",
      "source_sha256": "da2a466166eabace",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the kinds of herbs that are given to the sick so that they recover."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0066",
      "source_sha256": "32bdc09e3cd18ba0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now when King Solomon died, Hezekiah plastered the walls of the temple, and they were not found again."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0072",
      "source_sha256": "f4fa3004d48edc9b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Otherwise, I would have found the medicine and brought healing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0075",
      "source_sha256": "ab286f7c84a4228c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Again I said to the cherub,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0076",
      "source_sha256": "ce776cd013a8fed2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“My lord, I want you to tell me about the task of the cherubim, whose voices sound"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0077",
      "source_sha256": "331d5bdf056f4826",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in heaven, so that humanity is shaken on earth.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0078",
      "source_sha256": "0ace65de06923aa4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The cherub said to me, “Do you see these great winds stored in their storehouses, with the angels over them?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0079",
      "source_sha256": "80bd5f5acf031c7a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the trumpet gives a signal from inside the curtain, the winds that are there come out and blow upon the wings of the angel who is over the spring of dew. The angel moves his wings, and the dew comes upon the earth, and the seeds of the earth grow."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0081",
      "source_sha256": "2855d475bb2cee93",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If the trumpet does not sound, a mighty voice comes out of heaven, and abundant rain comes upon the earth and causes the crops to increase, along with the rainwater."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0098",
      "source_sha256": "e9a3934dd4931e4d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “Listen, and I will tell you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0116",
      "source_sha256": "dbf2b048cff7041c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For indeed, he created humanity without sin."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0117",
      "source_sha256": "2c80bbc34b7bff6f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Human beings themselves sin according to their own will"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0118",
      "source_sha256": "0baa21e6d6092811",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and according to the devil’s desire.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0119",
      "source_sha256": "d534ebbf0e62928f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I said to the cherub, “Human beings are born to suffering,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0120",
      "source_sha256": "7120363a6c02590a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as Job said, ‘My mother bore me to suffering.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/mysteries_john#CopScr.mysteries-john.001.0127",
      "source_sha256": "e9a3934dd4931e4d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to me, “Listen, and I will tell you.”"
    }
  ]
}
